- [dec2bin](<https://www.mathworks.com/help//releases/R2021a/symbolic/sym.dec2bin.html#:~:text=Description,-example&text=str%20%3D%20dec2bin(%20d%20)%20returns,character%20array%20with%20N%20rows>)
